From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:48:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XSystem and XSystemAnalytics.

XSystemGetConsoleId() and XSystemGetXboxLiveSandboxId() answer as on Windows ("00000000...00" and
"RETAIL"). XSystemGetAppSpecificDeviceId() returns a stable per-device, per-title id: the base64
of SHA-256 over the prefix's MachineGuid and the title id. XSystemGetAnalyticsInfo() reads
Windows.System.Profile.AnalyticsInfo, and reports a Windows 10 desktop when WinRT cannot answer:
titles dereference the result. The handle tracking functions remain stubs.

Ported from WineGDK (LGPL-2.1-or-later); changes are original work for macrock.

Topic: xsystem
